{"version":1,"content":"<p>曾任OpenAI工程師的35歲沙特籍男子阿卜杜勒拉赫曼·阿爾福贊（Abdulrahman Alfozan），涉嫌在OpenAI位於美國三藩市的辦公室藏匿加密錄音設備，被聯邦檢察官起訴。</p><p>檢察官指，他將黑色小型竊聽設備以衛生紙包裹，藏在一間會議室的電視機背後，該會議室供公司高層討論機密技術、策略及商業事務。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.943289+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T02:34:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:56:13.993944+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416436+00:00","content_hash":"62d280dd6b3aa71a1416f76a89962c2b5dfd54906bb608f8b882bbea01cbf1f6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}